sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Receptionist as Receptionist / Patient
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Receptionist->>System: requestOPCheckIn(patientId, appointmentId)
    activate System
    System->>System: verifyAppointmentCurrentDate()
    System->>System: updateStatusToCheckedIn()
    System->>System: generateQueueToken()
    System-->>Receptionist: issueQueueTokenTicket(tokenNumber, doctorRoom)
    deactivate System
